have to be respectful.

00:07:02.170 --> 00:07:05.018
- [Man] Okay, I understand.

00:07:05.018 --> 00:07:07.911
So, I was a software engineer.

00:07:07.911 --> 00:07:09.182
- I remember.

00:07:09.182 --> 00:07:10.654
- [Man] I was still in like 2017.

00:07:10.654 --> 00:07:11.639
- I remember.

00:07:11.639 --> 00:07:13.888
- [Man] Then I become an executive,

00:07:13.888 --> 00:07:15.403
