00:07:33.857 --> 00:07:36.900
and many companies in India to go there,

00:07:36.900 --> 00:07:38.040
promotions and everything.

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:40.281
And here also, I was telling you,

00:07:40.281 --> 00:07:41.650
and you know those writings I use

00:07:41.650 --> 00:07:44.931
