00:07:44.931 --> 00:07:46.746
I guess they have less
audiences there, I don't know.

00:07:46.746 --> 00:07:48.523
But I just want to tell you.

00:07:48.523 --> 00:07:49.521
- Thank you.

00:07:49.521 --> 00:07:51.800
- [Man] And I come here, last
night you were in Malaysia,

00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:54.110
